Version: financial years beginning after 2025-12-31, consolidated vägledning 2025-12-15. Point numbers marked *(earlier numbering)* come from pre-2025 consolidated texts and should be verified against the current PDF before being quoted in a note or memo. Tax rate used: 20.6 %.

